\\step1.md:12:parse.ts`)의 `positionalGirderMain`은 좌우 다른 端部를\nphases/21-asym-import\\step1.md:13:`主筋端部左右相違`로 거부한다. ADR-032로 모델이 비대칭을 담게 됐으므로,\nphases/21-asym-import\\step1.md:20:   - G51 R階·G55 R階(비대칭 4칸×상하)가 `主筋端部左右相違`+빈칸 → **위치별\nphases/21-asym-import\\step1.md:22:     `tests/fixtures/section-import/expected/yokohama-kanazawa-p14-girders.json`의\nphases/21-asym-import\\step1.md:24:   - G51 R階의 カットオフ 「[2500]」이 `cutoffFromSupportFaceMm` 후보 2500으로\nphases/21-asym-import\\step1.md:29:2. **`SectionCandidate.girderMain` 확장** (`types.ts`): 기존 대칭 필드는\nphases/21-asym-import\\step1.md:34:   `cutoffFromSupportFaceMm?: number`도 더하라.\nphases/21-asym-import\\step1.md:35:3. **파서**: `positionalGirderMain`에서 좌우가 다르면 거부 대신 위 형태로\nphases/21-asym-import\\step1.md:40:   - `主筋端部左右相違` 이슈 코드는 「径 불일치 등으로 비대칭조차 확정 못 한」\nphases/21-asym-import\\step1.md:63:바뀐 골든 핀 수, 잔여 `主筋端部左右相違` 경로 유무.\nphases/21-asym-import\\step1-codex.stdout.log:6:{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_3\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"\\\"C:\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\powershell.exe\\\" -Command 'git status --short; git log --oneline -5; Get-Content -Raw phases/21-asym-import/index.json; rg -n \\\"positionalGirderMain|SectionCandidate|主筋端部左右相違|cutoff|G51|G55|yokohama-kanazawa-p14\\\" src/lib/import/section-list tests/section-import tests/fixtures/section-import/expected phases/21-asym-import -S'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\",\"exit_code\":null,\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\nphases/21-asym-import\\step2.md:24:     `cutoffFromSupportFaceMm` 후보가 있으면 기존 칸 규칙(파싱된 칸만 덮기)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
